OL,3,GNEWSAHead of maternity review says 'we
OL,4,Awill listen to parents'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of a major review of maternity
OL,7,Fservices has reassured bereaved parents
OL,8,Ftheir voices will be heard as part of
OL,9,Fher work.
OL,11,FFamilies had expressed concern the
OL,12,Fforward-looking national review of
OL,13,Fservices in Scotland would not take
OL,14,Finto account how they felt failed by
OL,15,Fthe NHS.
OL,17,FBut Prof Christine McCourt told BBC
OL,18,FScotland talking to a range of people
OL,19,Fwould be valuable in "drawing the right
OL,20,Flessons for improvement".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
